{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Well, I'll head back to the office then.": "",
  "Well, I better head back\nto the office.": "",
  "I should tell Genda-sensei what we learned.": "",
  "I'll report everything\nto Genda-sensei.": "",
  "Yagami-san. I don't know what you want,\nbut I'm gonna have to ask you to leave.": "",
  "Yagami-san... I dunno why you're here,\nbut you better leave.": "",
  "Sorry, but I need to talk to Matsugane-san.": "",
  "I just want to ask\nMatsugane-san something.": "",
  "He's not here.\nCan't tell you where he is, either.": "",
  "He's not here.\nI can't tell you where he is.": "",
  "I told you, he's not here!": "",
  "I told you the boss\nisn't fucking here!": "",
  "Hm? Looking for Higashi-aniki?\nHe's back in his office.": "",
  "Huh? Looking for Higashi-aniki?\nHe's back in his office.": "",
  "What do you want?\nSticking your nose where it doesn't belong again?": "",
  "Huh? What now?\nYou still sniffing around?": "",
  "I need to know where Hamura is.": "",
  "I want to know where\nCaptain Hamura is.": "",
  "Still hiding.\nNot a clue where.": "",
  "Still in hiding somewhere.": "",
  "What about Matsugane-san?\nIs he back at the office?": "",
  "Then where's Matsugane-san?\nAt the office?": "",
  "Use your head, Tak.\nNo way he's gonna stick around there.": "",
  "Don't be an idiot.\nNo way he's gonna stick around.": "",
  "Hamura and the boss're in the same boat.": "",
  "He's hiding too. Hamura and the boss're\nin the same boat.": "",
  "Those Kyorei assholes would hunt 'em down\nin an instant if they were easy to track.": "",
  "If they were that easy to track,\nthose Kyorei assholes would have 'em by now.": "",
  "Exactly. Wherever they are now,\nthey're safe.": "",
  "No idea where that'd be, though.": "",
  "Still, no idea where that'd be.": "",
  "Can't you at least get in touch with 'em?": "",
  "Can't you at least get\nin touch with 'em?": "",
  "Just say we wanna have a few words.": "",
  "Just say we wanna have\na few words.": "",
  "I can try.\nI'll let you know once I figure shit out.": "",
  "...I can try. I'll let you know\nonce I figure shit out.": "",
  "You know how to pick up a phone, yeah?": "",
  "You know how to pick up\na phone, yeah?": "",
  "Hoshino-kun told me about Ayabe.\nSaid the Mole framed him.": "",
  "About Ayabe... Hoshino-kun told me his story.\nSaid the Mole framed him.": "",
  "Guess he's really behind all of this.": "",
  "After all that, guess it's no surprise\nthe Mole's behind all of this.": "",
  "Yup. Which brings us right\nback to Hamura.": "",
  "Yup. Which brings us right back to\nthe Mole's contact. Captain Hamura.": "",
  "We'll start from him and go\nfrom there. Plain and simple.": "",
  "We'll start there.\nPlain and simple.": "",
  "Let's just hope Matsugane-san\nknows where he is.": "",
  "Let's just hope the\ncaptain's on a short leash.": "",
  "Well, no point worrying about that\nuntil Higashi gets back to us.": "",
  "Well, guess we wait\nfor word from Higashi-san.": "",
  "Yo, it's Higashi.": "",
  "Hey, any word from Matsugane-san?\nWhat'd he say?": "",
  "Hey. Any word from Matsugane-san?\nWhat's he say?": "",
  "Meet at a restaurant called Kamuro Kikunoya.\nLittle ways outta the city.": "",
  "Meet at a restaurant called Kamuro Kikunoya.\nLittle ways off the main drag.": "",
  "Take a cab.\nThe boss is already there.": "",
  "Better grab a taxi.\nThe boss is already there.": "",
  "Got it. Thanks, Higashi.": "",
  "Kamuro Kikunoya, huh?": "",
  "Don't keep him waiting.": "",
  "Don't keep the boss waiting.": "",
  "Matsugane-san.\nOur guests have arrived.": "",
  "Boss, you have guests.": "",
  "Please, take a seat.": "",
  "It's been some time, Tak.": "",
  "And you I haven't seen since your expulsion.": "",
  "And you I haven't seen\nsince your expulsion.": "",
  "Matsugane-san. I'm sure Higashi mentioned this,\nbut I want to ask you directly.": "",
  "Matsugane-san. I'm sure Higashi mentioned,\nbut I want to ask you...": "",
  "Come, now.\nLet's at least have a drink first, huh?": "",
  "Come, now. Let's at least\nhave a drink first, right?": "",
  "Place is pretty fancy.": "",
  "It's been a while since\nthe three of us drank.": "",
  "We haven't drank together\nin a while.": "",
  "But Tak, I have a favor to ask.\nYou need to stay away from Hamura.": "",
  "...Look, Tak. From here out,\nstay away from Hamura.": "",
  "This family is nothing without him.\nHell, he's the only thing keeping us afloat.": "",
  "This family is nothing without Hamura.\nHell, he's the only thing keeping us afloat.": "",
  "Yeah, you told me that already.": "",
  "You've told me that already.": "",
  "Where <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> Hamura?": "",
  "I don't know.": "",
  "He has no reason to keep me\ninformed of his every move.": "",
  "He tells me what I need to know,\nnot the little details.": "",
  "Then why did you call us here?": "",
  "Then why call us all the way here?": "",
  "We didn't need to come all this way\nif that's all you had to tell us.": "",
  "This is a little much\njust to brush us off.": "",
  "In times like these it's hard\nto even enjoy a drink.": "",
  "In times like this...\neven the drinks go sour.": "",
  "The Mole you're searching for...\nis a hired gun employed by Hamura.": "",
  "The Mole you're searching for...\nis a hired gun, employed by Hamura.": "",
  "An assassin?": "",
  "Yes. It seems Hamura always turns to the same\nperson when he needs someone taken care of.": "",
  "Yes. It seems Hamura always turns to the same person\nwhen he needs someone taken care of.": "",
  "That's your killer, without a doubt.": "",
  "I'd bet that's your killer.": "",
  "Do you know anything about him?": "",
  "But who are they, really?": "",
  "No. But whoever he is,\nhe's a goddamn pro.": "",
  "Who indeed. Well, whoever he is,\nhe's goddamn good.": "",
  "He's killed several people now the exact\nsame way... yet barely left a trace.": "",
  "He's killed several people now the exact\nsame way... but barely left a trace.": "",
  "Do you know what he looks like, at least?": "",
  "Do you know what the Mole\nlooks like, at least?": "",
  "No. The only one who does... is Hamura.": "",
  "No. Only one man knows\nthe Mole's face... Hamura.": "",
  "Are you still going to pursue this, Tak?": "",
  "Tak. Are you still going to pursue this?": "",
  "You should know, even if you track down\nHamura and the Mole... that won't be the end of it.": "",
  "But even if you track down Hamura\nand the Mole... that won't be the end of it.": "",
  "They're just puppets on a stage\nmuch larger than you realize.": "",
  "They're just puppets on a stage.\nA stage larger than you realize.": "",
  "And once you step foot on that stage,\nthere's no hiding from the limelight.": "",
  "Do you understand!?": "",
  "You get that!?\nDo you understand me!?": "",
  "I'd rather try and regret\nit than never try at all.": "",
  "If I'm going to regret this,\nit can wait until I've finished the job.": "",
  "Hmph. Nobody listens to\ntheir elders these days.": "",
  "Hmph. I've tried to give you sound advice,\nbut nobody listens to their elders these days.": "",
  "Sorry about this, Boss.\nSeriously.": "",
  "Boss... I'm sorry about this.": "",
  "Can I say just one thing, Matsugane-san?": "",
  "Matsugane-san, can I say just one thing?": "",
  "The Matsugane Family I know would never\nturn a blind eye to cold-blooded murder like this.": "",
  "I know the Matsugane Family by now. It'd never\nturn a blind eye to cold-blooded murder like this.": "",
  "You say you can't exist without Hamura, but...": "",
  "You say you can't exist\nwithout Hamura, but...": "",
  "Don't make me repeat myself. Times have changed.\nHamura is the Matsugane Family now.": "",
  "Don't make me repeat myself. Times have changed.\nHamura <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> the Matsugane Family now.": "",
  "It's not my place to interfere anymore.": "",
  "It's not my place to\ninterfere anymore.": "",
  "That's my prerogative as patriarch.": "",
  "Thank you, for everything.": "",
  "Thank you. For everything.": "",
  "All that and still\nno clue where Hamura is.": "",
  "After all that, we've still got\nno clue where Hamura is.": "",
  "We're back to square one.": "",
  "Not exactly.\nThe boss slipped us a pretty big hint.": "",
  "Not exactly. The boss did give us somethin'...\na pretty big hint.": "",
  "When he was talking about Captain Hamura.": "",
  "He said Hamura's keeping the\nMatsugane Family afloat.": "",
  "He might be in hiding, yeah...\nBut the family looks to Hamura for guidance now.": "",
  "Hamura may be hiding, but he's still in command.\nThe family looks to him for guidance now.": "",
  "He's gotta be communicating\nwith them somehow.": "",
  "So I figure, he's gotta be communicating\nwith them from wherever he is.": "",
  "If we can just listen in on one of their conversations,\nthat should lead us straight to him.": "",
  "If we can just listen in on their conversations,\nthat should lead us straight to Hamura.": "",
  "We just gotta get ears in there.\nYou follow me?": "",
  "So... you get what I'm saying?": "",
  "I think I do.\nYou wanna bug their office.": "",
  "I think I get the picture.\nYou wanna bug their office.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(True, that might lead us\nstraight to Hamura...)</color>": "",
  "But after everything that\njust went down...": "",
  "You know what'll happen\nif we get caught. They'll kill us.": "",
  "We can't just storm the place.\nThey'll kill us on sight.": "",
  "Which means we'll just have to enlist\nthe help of an expert burglar.": "",
  "Yeah. Which means we'll have to enlist\nthe help of an expert burglar.": "",
  "Aha. You wanna make Sugiura do it.": "",
  "Aha, I get it. You wanna\nmake Sugiura do it.": "",
  "I'll give him a ring.\nYou go track down some bugs.": "",
  "I'll see if I can get ahold of Sugiura.\nYou go track down some bugs.": "",
  "Me...?": "",
  "Make sure they're HD audio and shit.\nMeet me at the office once you've got 'em.": "",
  "(We can't afford to\ndo this half-assed.)": "",
  "(If it's technology I need, Tsukumo's the guy.\nBet he's over at his usual haunt.)": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-shi.\nWhat is it this time?": "",
  "Yagami-shi. What is it this time?": "",
  "I'm trying to keep this on the down-low here...\nBut I'm looking for bugs.": "",
  "I'm trying to keep this on the down-low here...\nbut I'm looking for bugs.": "",
  "Think you can help me with that?": "",
  "Tsukumo... Think you can\nhelp me with that?": "",
  "Hehe, you know who you're talking to,\nright? Of course I can!": "",
  "Hehe, you know who you're talking to, right?\nOf course I can!": "",
  "Thought so.": "",
  "Well, anytime works for me as long\nas I've got the parts.": "",
  "Long as you've got the parts,\nI can start working anytime.": "",
  "You're gonna make them by hand?": "",
  "You're gonna... make them by hand?": "",
  "Won't find a safer pair of hands than literally\nmy pair of hands. Plus you get a friend discount!": "",
  "Tsukumo-guaranteed! They're the best in town,\nand I'd know. Plus, you get a friend discount!": "",
  "If you say so. Anyway, what do you need?\nI'll run to a department store and pick 'em up.": "",
  "Okay, if you say so. So what parts do you need?\nI'll make a supply run.": "",
  "Hehe, no need! Here's a riddle: \"You can get me from here,\nbut I am not here. What am I?\"": "",
  "Hehe, it's not like you've gotta go out of your way!\n\"You can get me from here, but I am not here. What am I?\"": "",
  "...What.": "",
  "Online shopping! Things get here in no-time with rush\nshipping. I'll just need you to give me the cash.": "",
  "Online shopping! With rush shipping, we can get parts\nin no time! I'll just need some cash, Yagami-shi.": "",
  "How much are we talking?": "",
  "How much?": "",
  "For parts and labor...\nLet's say, 100,000?": "",
  "For assorted parts and labor...\nlet's say, 100,000?": "",
  "That's with your friend discount?": "",
  "That's <font_kind=yakuza_italic>with</font_kind> your friend discount?": "",
  "Hehe, yes sir! I'm taking a loss\non it for you, Yagami-shi.": "",
  "Hehe, of course!\nI'm taking a loss on it for you.": "",
  "...All right.": "",
  "...Yeah, all right.": "",
  "Just let me know when you have\nthe money and I'll put the order in!": "",
  "Well, let me know when you have the money.\nI'll put in the order for our parts.": "",
  "That money burning a hole in your pocket?\nIt's gonna run you 100 grand for parts and labor.": "",
  "Got money burning a hole in your pocket?\nFor all the parts and labor, it's gonna be 100 grand.": "",
  "That's a lot of cash, Tsukumo.": "",
  "That's a lot of cash.": "",
  "But these bugs are gonna be the best of the best, I promise!\nYou won't believe your eyes. Or I guess your ears, hehe!": "",
  "Believe me, you'll get the quality you pay for!\nThese'll be top of the line! Way better than store-bought!": "",
  "All right, all right.\nI'll get you your money.": "",
  "All right.\nI'll get you your money.": "",
  "I'll be waiting!\nJust let me know whenever you're ready!": "",
  "I'm ready to start production anytime,\nso just let me know when.": "",
  "Yep. Here you go.": "",
  "Hehe, thanks!": "",
  "It's gonna take a while,\nbut I'll let you know when I'm done.": "",
  "Now, it's gonna take a while,\nbut I'll call you as soon as I'm done.": "",
  "Sure. Sounds good.": "",
  "Actually, hold on.\nDon't know if I have the cash to spare.": "",
  "Actually, hold on.\nNot sure I can spare it.": "",
  "Hehe, the long-awaited time has come!\nYour order is ready!": "",
  "Hehe! Thank you for waiting.\nThe moment's here! Your order is ready!": "",
  "Long!? Felt like you did that\npretty fast, actually!": "",
  "You're already done!?": "",
  "I'll be waiting in the usual spot.\nMind coming over?": "",
  "So, want to drop by?\nI'll be waiting in the usual spot.": "",
  "Not at all.\nSee you in a bit.": "",
  "Works for me. See you soon.": "",
  "Hmm? You got here fast, Yagami-shi.": "",
  "Hmm? Yagami-shi,\nyou got here fast.": "",
  "Says the guy who makes\nbugs in ten minutes.": "",
  "Says the guy who makes bugs\nin ten minutes.": "",
  "Hehe, well I can't refuse a compliment!\nHere you go.": "",
  "Hehe! Who am I to refuse a compliment?\nNow, here you go.": "",
  "They're designed to blend into a power outlet,\nso just plug it in. Oh, and the signal range is 100 meters.": "",
  "You just plug them in an outlet. They're pretty unobtrusive.\nAnd the signal range is 100 meters. Pretty powerful waves.": "",
  "It'll even go through metal plates or other obstacles,\nmeaning you can listen from, say... the roof of a building?": "",
  "It'll even go through metal plates or other obstacles.\nPerfect for listening from a rooftop, just for example.": "",
  "That's perfect.\nI think this is gonna work.": "",
  "Very nice. That's just what we need.": "",
  "You can turn them off remotely, too, so you don't\nhave to listen constantly if you don't want to.": "",
  "You can turn them off remotely, too.\nBetter to deactivate them when you're not listening.": "",
  "I have to say, even a great detective like you\nwould have trouble finding these, Yagami-shi!": "",
  "You're a great detective and all, Yagami-shi,\nbut even you'd have trouble tracing these! Hehe!": "",
  "I'm not sure that's entirely true...\nBut thanks anyway. You're a lifesaver, Tsukumo.": "",
  "I'm not sure that's entirely true... but thank you.\nYou're a lifesaver.": "",
  "Hehe, you're very welcome!": "",
  "Hey, just stopping by for a bit.": "",
  "Hey. Just stopping by for a bit.": "",
  "...More like I got dragged\nhere against my will.": "",
  "More accurately, he dragged me here.": "",
  "You get the bugs, Tak?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "I don't know.": "ฉันไม่รู้",
  "Do you understand!?": "เข้าใจไหมครับ!?",
  "Me...?": "ฉัน...?",
  "Thought so.": "คิดว่างั้นแหละ",
  "How much?": "เท่าไหร่?",
  "...All right.": "...ก็ได้"
 }
}
